# ldr pc, [r0] loads RET, the lr the function was called with. An indirect jump to the
# entry lr is a return (a C return), so nothing is looked up and the snippet just ends.
title: ldr pc, [r0] that loads the entry lr is a return, not a dispatch
ref: A8.8 LDR (immediate, Thumb) T3 with Rt = 15: LoadWritePC(); ADR 0014: an indirect jump to the entry lr is a return

[code]
d0f800f0    ldr.w pc, [r0]

[in]
r0 = DATA
word DATA = RET

[out]
r0 = DATA
